  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study on responsible wateruse in horticulture project Grootvlei</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This study concerns a study in the framework of the Grootvlei combitrack and development of horticulture. The study will calculate how much water is needed for the planned horticulture project (supported by combitrack &amp; impact cluster) and what will be the most sustainable and future proof source of water tin the area to use while respecing the communities and ecosystems.</narrative>
  </description>
